Directions
                                
                                        
                                            Preheat oven to 350°. In a large bowl, combine cream, salt, pepper and, if desired, thyme. Arrange potatoes in a greased 13x9-in. baking dish. Pour cream mixture over top.
                                        
                                        
                                               Bake, uncovered, 45-55 minutes or until potatoes are tender and top is lightly browned. Let stand 10 minutes before serving.
                                                    Yield: 10 servings. 
                                        
                                



                                
                                    
                                        
                                            Originally published as Super Simple Scalloped Potatoes in  Taste of Home
November  2015, p57                                                
                                    
                                
                                

                                        

                                            

                
                
